= Margarita Nelken

Margarita Nelken is a writer and art historian from a cosmopolitan background who was radicalized into <span style="color: #c00000;">socialism</span> by the misery of the Extremaduran countryside. A <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> deputy on the party's left, she is a fierce advocate for the landless and for working women.

