@left_unity
title: Left-Center Unity
subtitle: Encourage cooperation between the left and centre wings of the party.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 10; labor_dissent -= 5; center_dissent -= 10; reformist_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_dissent -= 5

We have reduced dissent among the party's factions.

@organizing_women
title: Organizing women
subtitle: Nelken's strategies reach working women and the wives of the landless.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: womens_rights += 1; industrial_psoe += 3*(1-dissent); landless_psoe += 5*(1-dissent); advisor_action_timer = 6

Nelken's message reaches working women and the wives of braceros, and we have recruited among them.

[? if psoe_r < 25 : Unfortunately, women still disproportionately support the clerical parties. ?]

@against_toleration
title: Against toleration
subtitle: Withdraw the PSOE's support and force a government crisis.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if psoe_toleration == 0 : The <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> is not currently tolerating a government. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and psoe_toleration
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time + 3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time + 3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12; psoe_toleration = 0; left_strength += 8; pro_republic -= 4; coup_progress += 2; urban_middle_psoe -= 3; smallholder_psoe -= 3; catholic_psoe -= 3; reformist_dissent += 8; left_dissent -= 5; izq_rep_relation -= 8; radical_relation -= 4

Nelken has grown tired of propping up a government the party does not lead. We withdraw our support and throw the government into crisis.

New elections have been set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].

@crisis
title: Addressing the economic crisis
subtitle: Nelken can help support a left-wing economic program.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and nationalization_adopted == 0 and black_thursday_seen == 1 and nationalization_support <= 5
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if black_thursday_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?][? if nationalization_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the Left plan. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6;
go-to: crisis_program.support_left
